# T27_PIN: t27c gen-rust files vendored into crates/trios-chat.
#
# One row per vendored file (rings/<R>/src/t27gen/<stem>.rs). Columns are
# separated by " | ":
#   file           path relative to crates/trios-chat/
#   spec path      .t27 spec path in gHashTag/t27
#   t27 SHA        40-hex gHashTag/t27 commit the spec was generated from
#   t27c built_by  the built_by string of the t27c that generated the file
#   sha256         64-hex lowercase SHA-256 of the vendored file (always filled)
#   seal file      .trinity/seals/<file>.json on that t27 SHA, or "unsealed on master"
#
# tests/t27_pin.rs recomputes the sha256 of every row. Lines starting with '#'
# and blank lines are ignored. The table is empty until the first swap.
file | spec path | t27 SHA | t27c built_by | sha256 | seal file
